TTU Choirs take over New York City! 📍 We had the incredible chance to perform at Carnegie Hall under our very own, Dr. Alan Zabriskie’s direction. What an honor to collaborate with National Concerts and sing alongside top choirs from across the nation. Our talented groups premiered Patrick Vu’s breathtaking new piece, I Will Walk These Woods with You, along with an incredible repertoire. An unforgettable experience and great memories made 🍎✈️🗽
